		<div id="text-74" class="sidebar-box widget_text clr">			<div class="textwidget"><h3>Learn More About Narrative Therapy</h3>
<hr>
</div>
		</div><div id="text-75" class="sidebar-box widget_text clr">			<div class="textwidget"><h4>What is Narrative Practice? Free Online Course</h4>
<p><a href="https://dulwichcentre.com.au/courses/what-is-narrative-practice-a-free-course/"><img decoding="async" class="alignleft wp-image-49337" src="https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/what-is-narrative-practice-books-shutterstock-150x150.jpg" alt="" width="100" height="67" srcset="https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/what-is-narrative-practice-books-shutterstock-300x200.jpg 300w, https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/what-is-narrative-practice-books-shutterstock-768x512.jpg 768w, https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/what-is-narrative-practice-books-shutterstock-200x133.jpg 200w, https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/what-is-narrative-practice-books-shutterstock.jpg 1000w" sizes="(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px" /></a>Curious about narrative therapy or looking for a refresher? Our popular online course offers an ‘intro’ to narrative practice.</p>
<p><a href="https://dulwichcentre.com.au/courses/what-is-narrative-practice-a-free-course/">Click here &gt;&gt;</a></p>
<hr>
<h4>About the Dulwich Centre</h4>
<p><a href="https://dulwichcentre.com.au/about-dulwich-centre/"><img decoding="async" class="alignleft wp-image-48932" src="https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/DC-building-150x150.png" alt="" width="100" height="56" srcset="https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/DC-building-300x167.png 300w, https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/DC-building-1024x569.png 1024w, https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/DC-building-768x426.png 768w, https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/DC-building-1536x853.png 1536w, https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/DC-building-2048x1137.png 2048w, https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/DC-building-800x450.png 800w, https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/DC-building-128x72.png 128w, https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/DC-building-200x111.png 200w" sizes="(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px" /></a>Founded in 1983 in Adelaide, Australia (on Kaurna Land), the Dulwich Centre is one of the key international ‘homes’ of narrative practice.</p>
<p><a href="https://dulwichcentre.com.au/about-dulwich-centre/">Read our story here &gt;&gt;</a></p>
<hr>
<h4>Stay in Touch</h4>
<p><a href="https://dulwichcentre.com.au/email-news/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignleft wp-image-28241" src="https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1470399667_Newsletter.png" alt="" width="100" height="100" srcset="https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1470399667_Newsletter.png 128w, https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1470399667_Newsletter-100x100.png 100w, https://dulwichcentre.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1470399667_Newsletter-45x45.png 45w" sizes="(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px" /></a><a href="https://dulwichcentre.com.au/email-news/">Subscribe to our email news</a> to stay up-to-date with news related to narrative therapy events, publications and projects.</p>
<p><strong>Follow us on social media:</strong><br />
<a href="https://www.facebook.com/DulwichCentreFoundation/">Facebook</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/dulwichcentre/">Instagram</a>, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/dulwich-centre">LinkedIn</a>.</p>
